\pard\s1\sa220 Executive Summary\par
\pard\s0\sa160 Product Catalogue is a React Native shopping-catalogue demonstration. Users can browse a built-in product list, search by product name, view product information, add products to a local cart, adjust quantities, and see a calculated order total. Cart data is persisted on the device between app launches.\par
\pard\s0\sa160 The application is implemented in TypeScript with React Native 0.87, React Navigation, AsyncStorage, and vector icons. The product list is currently static source data; there is no remote catalogue service, account system, checkout, payment processing, or order submission.\par
