\pard\s1\sa220 Product Scope and Features\par
\pard\s2\sa120 Included\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Home tab with a scrollable product list and product cards.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Case-insensitive product-name search, debounced by 500 milliseconds.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Product detail screen with image, category, description, price, and displayed rating.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Cart tab with quantity controls, item subtotals, subtotal, delivery label, and total.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Device-local cart persistence using AsyncStorage.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Tab navigation between Home and Cart, plus stack navigation to product details.\par
\pard\s2\sa120 Not Included\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Checkout, payment, shipping address, order confirmation, or order history.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab User authentication, cloud synchronization, or a backend API.\par
\pard\s0\li360\fi-180\sa100 \bullet\tab Category filters, stock availability, product variants, or server-driven pricing.\par
\pard\s1\sa220 User Guide\par
\pard\s2\sa120 Browse and search\par
\pard\s0\sa120 Open the Home tab to view all available products. Each product card shows its image, name, category, and price. Tap a card to open its detail screen. Enter text into the search field to filter by product name. Search ignores letter case and matches names only; filtering is applied after a 500 ms pause in typing. Pull down on the Home list to clear the search and restore the full list.\par
\pard\s2\sa120 View a product and add it\par
\pard\s0\sa120 A product detail page shows the product image, category, name, price, description, and a displayed rating of 4.5. Tap Add to Cart to add one unit. When the item is already in the cart, use the plus and minus controls to change its quantity. The cart icon opens the Cart tab; its badge reflects the total quantity of all products.\par
\pard\s2\sa120 Manage the cart\par
\pard\s0\sa120 In the Cart tab, each row shows the product, unit price, quantity, and line total. Use plus to add one unit and minus to remove one. Decreasing an item from quantity one removes it from the cart. The summary adds each unit price multiplied by its quantity. Delivery is displayed as FREE, and the total currently equals the subtotal.\par
\pard\s0\sa120 When the cart is empty, the app displays an empty-state message and a Start Shopping action that navigates to Home. Cart contents are stored locally and normally remain available after restarting the app on the same installation. Clearing app data or uninstalling may remove this locally stored cart.\par
