\pard\s1\sa220 Application Structure\par
\pard\s0\sa120 The source is organized by responsibility. The main entry point wraps navigation in safe-area and cart providers; screens compose reusable components and theme modules.\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 App.tsx\tab App composition, safe-area provider, cart provider, navigation container\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/navigation/\tab Root stack and Home/Cart bottom tabs\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/screens/\tab Home, product details, and cart screens\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/components/\tab Header, product card, search field, and cart item\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/context/cartContext.tsx\tab Shared cart state, mutations, derived count and total, persistence\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/data/products.ts\tab Static sample catalogue\par
\pard\s0\li360\sa80\f1\fs19 src/types/product.ts\tab Product and CartItem type definitions\par
